 "rule_ja": "Judge (numbers lens) for 仕上げ33修正01: one common vertex-level geometry/motion measure for\nbefore (仕上げ33 fix02), SWEEP and Houdini claw layers. Report only; writes JSON under _judge/numbers.\n\nPer claw set:\n  - standing: per entry max signed height of its vertices above the t* K*' sheet (nearest sheet vertex normal), by kind.\n  - penetration (self-intersection with the sheet): vertices with h < -0.05 m and tangential offset < 0.3 m at t 9 / 10.5 / 12 s,\n    split into root part (u <= 0.3) and body/tip (u > 0.3); entries with any body/tip vertex below; deepest.\n  - motion: per entry and frame, max vertex step relative to the entry root step (m), and max second difference\n    relative to root (jitter / pop); counts over thresholds; growth extent (max root distance) decreases before t*.\n",
